    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription id="f-202" contextRef="c-35">Enable Mississippi River Transmission, LLC is a Delaware Limited Liability Company and was organized as such on December 31, 2010, under the name of CenterPoint Energy Mississippi River Transmission Company, LLC.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription>
    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription id="f-203" contextRef="c-35">Not applicable</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription>
    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-204" contextRef="c-35">Enable Mississippi River Transmission, LLC provides transportation and other pipeline services for customers, including gas producers, marketers, local distribution companies, end users and others in the states of Arkansas, Illinois, Louisiana, Missouri, and Texas.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
